  # --- cliff face (surface feature, not passage wall) ----------------
  # `slope` draws the scarp hachures. It is not a wall type, so it would
  # default to -outline none and drop out of the scrap boundary; the
  # explicit -outline out keeps the passage fill closed against it.
  # l-size sets the hachure length in drawing units and must be given on
  # at least one point.
