  # --- cliff face, continued east of the entrances -------------------
  # Point order reversed (was NE->SW) so it runs the same way as the
  # western segment. Slope hachures hang off one side of the line, so
  # two segments of the same cliff drawn in opposite directions end up
  # with ticks on opposite sides. Note `-reverse on` does NOT work here:
  # it flips the geometry but leaves l-size attached to what is now the
  # last point, and Therion then fails with "no slope size specification
  # at any line point". Reverse the coordinates instead.
